{"sha": "97753757a8887babad3a699a5f17131fad5ba020bf7f9b41a08805f84ca459b9", "body": ["\\textbf{6.} 给定 $M$，取 $N$，使得 $\\frac{a_{k+1} -", "a_k}{b_{k+1} - b_k} \\geq M$ 当 $k \\geq N$ 时成立；由第 3 小题的", "下半部分可得 $a_n - a_N \\geq M(b_n - b_N)$，于是", "\\[", "\\frac{a_n}{b_n} \\geq \\frac{a_N}{b_n} +", "M\\Bigl(1 - \\frac{b_N}{b_n}\\Bigr) \\longrightarrow M .", "\\]", "从某项开始，$\\frac{a_n}{b_n} \\geq M - 1$；由于 $M$ 是", "任意的，故 $\\frac{a_n}{b_n} \\to +\\infty$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 取 $b_n = n$，$a_n = u_1 + \\dots + u_n$，则", "增量商为 $u_{n+1} \\to \\ell$，于是切萨罗平均", "$\\frac{a_n}{n}$ 趋于 $\\ell$，此即", "\\cref{exo:b1:seq:10} 的（1）。取 $a_n = u_n$，则增量商", "为 $u_{n+1} - u_n$，即得（3）。反之：取 $a_n = (-1)^n$，", "$b_n = n$，则 $\\frac{a_n}{b_n} \\to 0$，但 $a_{n+1} - a_n = \\pm", "2$ 交替变化，增量商没有极限。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 乘以共轭式：", "\\[", "\\bigl((1+h)^{3/2} - 1\\bigr)\\bigl((1+h)^{3/2} + 1\\bigr)", "= (1+h)^3 - 1 = 3h + 3h^2 + h^3 .", "\\]", "取 $h = \\frac1n$，则 $n\\bigl((1 + \\frac1n)^{3/2} - 1\\bigr) =", "\\frac{3 + 3/n + 1/n^2}{(1 + 1/n)^{3/2} + 1}$，且 $1 \\leq (1 +", "\\frac1n)^{3/2} \\leq (1 + \\frac1n)^2 \\to 1$（夹逼），故", "分母趋于 $2$，从而该式趋于 $\\frac32$。现", "用施托尔茨定理，取 $a_n = T_n$，$b_n = n^{3/2}$（严格递增，", "$\\to +\\infty$):", "\\[", "\\frac{\\sqrt{n+1}}{(n+1)^{3/2} - n^{3/2}}", "= \\frac{\\sqrt{n+1}}{\\sqrt n} \\cdot", "\\frac{1}{n\\bigl((1 + \\frac1n)^{3/2} - 1\\bigr)}", "\\longrightarrow 1 \\cdot \\frac{2}{3},", "\\]", "从而 $T_n \\sim \\frac23\\,n^{3/2}$。（第 2 小题的夹逼", "只将常数夹在 $\\intcc{0.35}{1}$ 中；施托尔茨定理则确定了它。）", "", "\\textbf{9.} 在 $u = \\ln(1+t)$ 处用（G1）：$1 + t = \\eu^{\\ln(1+t)} \\geq", "1 + \\ln(1+t)$，故 $\\ln(1+t) \\leq t$。取 $u =", "-\\frac{t}{1+t}$，由（G1）得 $\\eu^{-t/(1+t)} \\geq 1 - \\frac{t}{1+t} =", "\\frac{1}{1+t} > 0$；两边取 $\\ln$（单调递增），", "$-\\frac{t}{1+t} \\geq -\\ln(1+t)$，即 $\\ln(1+t) \\geq", "\\frac{t}{1+t}$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $\\ln$ 严格递增", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:functions:expln}），且 $\\ln(2^k) = k\\ln 2$ 无界，", "故 $\\ln n \\to +\\infty$。关于增量，取 $t =", "\\frac1n$，由第 9 小题，", "\\[", "\\frac 1{n+1} = \\frac{1/n}{1 + 1/n} \\leq", "\\ln\\Bigl(1 + \\frac1n\\Bigr) \\leq \\frac1n", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\frac{n}{n+1} \\leq \\frac{1/(n+1)}{\\ln(1 + 1/n)} \\leq 1 ,", "\\]", "故增量商 $\\frac{H_{n+1} - H_n}{\\ln(n+1) - \\ln", "n}$ 趋于 $1$，由施托尔茨定理得 $H_n \\sim \\ln n$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 记 $x_n = \\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n} \\to L$，$t_n =", "\\frac{x_n}{L} - 1 \\to 0$。由第 9 小题，$\\frac{t_n}{1 + t_n} \\leq", "\\ln(1 + t_n) \\leq t_n$，故 $\\ln x_n - \\ln L = \\ln(1 + t_n) \\to", "0$（夹逼）。对 $(\\ln x_k)$ 应用切萨罗平均（第 7 小题）：", "\\[", "\\frac1n \\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\ln x_k = \\frac{\\ln u_n - \\ln u_0}{n}", "\\longrightarrow \\ln L ,", "\\]", "故 $\\frac{\\ln u_n}{n} \\to \\ln L$。记 $h_n = \\frac{\\ln u_n}{n}", "- \\ln L \\to 0$，则 $u_n^{1/n} = L\\,\\eu^{h_n}$，由（G1）得", "$1 + h_n \\leq \\eu^{h_n} \\leq \\frac{1}{1 - h_n}$（当 $h_n < 1$ 时），", "故 $\\eu^{h_n} \\to 1$，从而 $u_n^{1/n} \\to L$。应用：取 $u_n =", "\\binom{2n}{n}$，则", "\\[", "\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n} = \\frac{(2n+1)(2n+2)}{(n+1)^2}", "= \\frac{2(2n+1)}{n+1} \\longrightarrow 4 ,", "\\qquad\\text{从而}\\qquad", "\\binom{2n}{n}^{1/n} \\to 4 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{12.} 当 $0 < x \\leq 1$ 时，由（G2）得 $\\sin x \\geq x(1 -", "\\frac{x^2}{6}) \\geq \\frac{5x}{6} > 0$，且", "\\[", "x - \\sin x \\geq \\frac{x^3}{6} - \\frac{x^5}{120}", "= x^3\\Bigl(\\frac16 - \\frac{x^2}{120}\\Bigr)", "\\geq \\frac{19}{120}\\,x^3 > 0 :", "\\]", "于是 $0 < \\sin x < x$ 在 $\\intoc{0}{1}$ 上成立。又 $u_1 = \\sin u_0", "\\in \\intcc{-1}{1}$。若 $u_1 = 0$，则 $u_n = 0$ 对所有 $n \\geq 1$ 成立。", "若 $u_1 \\in \\intoc{0}{1}$，由归纳法得 $0 < u_{n+1} = \\sin u_n", "< u_n \\leq 1$，故 $(u_n)_{n\\geq1}$ 严格递减，且", "有下界 $0$，故收敛于某个 $\\ell \\in", "\\intco{0}{1}$（见\\cref{thm:b1:seq:monotone}）。由和差化积公式", "及（G2）可得 $\\abs{\\sin a - \\sin b} = 2\\abs{\\cos", "\\frac{a+b}{2}}\\,\\abs{\\sin\\frac{a-b}{2}} \\leq \\abs{a - b}$，故", "$u_{n+1} = \\sin u_n \\to \\sin \\ell$，于是 $\\ell = \\sin\\ell$。若 $\\ell", "> 0$，则 $\\sin\\ell < \\ell$，矛盾。故 $u_n \\to 0$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 将（G2）除以 $u_n > 0$：", "\\[", "1 - \\frac{u_n^2}{6} \\leq \\frac{\\sin u_n}{u_n} \\leq 1 -", "\\frac{u_n^2}{6} + \\frac{u_n^4}{120} \\leq 1 ,", "\\]", "由 $u_n \\to 0$ 夹逼得 $\\frac{\\sin u_n}{u_n} \\to 1$。将", "$x - \\sin x$ 除以 $x^3$：", "\\[", "\\frac16 - \\frac{u_n^2}{120} \\leq \\frac{u_n - \\sin u_n}{u_n^3}", "\\leq \\frac16 \\longrightarrow \\frac16 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{14.} 由于 $u_{n+1} = \\sin u_n$，有", "\\[", "w_n = \\frac{u_n^2 - \\sin^2 u_n}{u_n^2 \\sin^2 u_n}", "= \\frac{(u_n - \\sin u_n)(u_n + \\sin u_n)}{u_n^2 \\sin^2 u_n}", "= \\frac{u_n - \\sin u_n}{u_n^3}\\cdot", "\\frac{u_n + \\sin u_n}{u_n}\\cdot", "\\Bigl(\\frac{u_n}{\\sin u_n}\\Bigr)^{2}", "\\]", "（检查 $u_n$ 的幂次：$3 + 1 + (-4)$，与分母 $u_n^2$", "及分子 $u_n^4$ 对照）。由第 13 小题，", "三个因子分别趋于 $\\frac16$、$2$、$1$，故 $w_n \\to \\frac13$。", ""]}